{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827540795392110","content":"Huge Cryptid, lawful neutral\nArmor Class 19 (natural armor)\nHit Points 207 (18d12 + 60)\nSpeed 40 ft., burrow 40 ft., climb 40 ft., fly 80 ft.\nSTR    DEX    CON    INT    WIS    CHA\n23 (+6)    23 (6)    22(+6)    20 (+5)    17 (+3)    18 (+4)\nSaving Throws Dex +8, Con +10, Wis +8, Cha +9\nSkills History +9, Perception +13, Persuasion +14, Stealth +8 insight +9\nDamage Immunities poison, psychic\nCondition Immunities frightened\nSenses blindsight 60 ft., darkvision 120 ft., passive Perception 23\nLanguages telepathy 120 ft., all","created_at":"2020-08-15T10:12:43.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744136484650745886","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
